    "notes": "The Windsor Hotel exterior circa 1912, with the original Second Empire hotel at Peel and Dorchester, the adjoining 1906–09 north annex at Cypress, and the two open service courts shown in the Goad atlas. Interior rooms and contemporary neighboring buildings are outside the reconstruction. The atlas scan was registered uniformly to the surviving Cypress corners. The original street edges and interior limits are approximate at that scale."
